{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Rush Highway</strong> takes the classic overtaking mechanics and transforms them into something entirely new. Forget ordinary highways \u2014 here you\u2019ll encounter giant chickens, zebras, ancient pyramids, glowing skulls, and surreal retro cityscapes. It\u2019s not just a reflex challenge; it\u2019s a visual and artistic journey.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>High-speed endless overtaking gameplay<br></li><li>Retro neon environments inspired by the 80s and 90s<br></li><li>Surreal surprises: giant animals, glowing artifacts, strange parallel worlds<br></li><li>Multiple vehicle choices to master<br></li><li>Addictive, replayable arcade experience</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Rush Highway appeals both to fans of classic arcade racers and to players who want to explore unusual, dreamlike atmospheres. Every run is a new scene, a new surprise, a new adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040530?t=1759774561","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040530/63582233e9b41c19f9feeead68d04a90bc1966ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759774561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040530/c2df280d774b7b3326d1f1a9f6052c20873edcc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759774561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040530/c2df280d774b7b3326d1f1a9f6052c20873edcc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759774561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Rush Highway</strong> takes the classic overtaking mechanics and transforms them into something entirely new. Forget ordinary highways \u2014 here you\u2019ll encounter giant chickens, zebras, ancient pyramids, glowing skulls, and surreal retro cityscapes. It\u2019s not just a reflex challenge; it\u2019s a visual and artistic journey.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>High-speed endless overtaking gameplay<br></li><li>Retro neon environments inspired by the 80s and 90s<br></li><li>Surreal surprises: giant animals, glowing artifacts, strange parallel worlds<br></li><li>Multiple vehicle choices to master<br></li><li>Addictive, replayable arcade experience</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Rush Highway appeals both to fans of classic arcade racers and to players who want to explore unusual, dreamlike atmospheres. Every run is a new scene, a new surprise, a new adventure.</p>","developers":["Berk Kalfa"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040530/9cfd1f575043b792c752691634775ec5924f524e/header.jpg?t=1759774561","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4040530/232762303/bc5a446fe29d21955dbd2b6fa61fd31ad5c4acf5/1758096405/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758566747","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4040530/232762303/bc5a446fe29d21955dbd2b6fa61fd31ad5c4acf5/1758096405/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758566747","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4040530/232762303/bc5a446fe29d21955dbd2b6fa61fd31ad5c4acf5/1758096405/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758566747","id":257199527,"name":"Gamepla